{
  "name" : "Lee2008 - ERK and PI3K signal integration by Myc",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>Mechanisitc model of PI3K and ERK signal integration by Myc. ERK and PI3K regulated Myc satbility by phosphorylating the same. (PMID:18463697)</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
